### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### list diet entries for a date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/diet?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### set the diet entry of a day
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/diet/2026-11-27
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "status": "MORE",
  "comment": "Pizza night"
}

### clear the diet entry of a day
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/diet/2026-11-27
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
